!Sample_source_name_ch1 = bone marrow-derived myeloid progenitor cells
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell types: cells transduced with shRNA in LEP vector
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = mouse strain: C57/BL/6
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment time: day 3 post-infection
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = For RNA-seq in cells transduced with dox-regulated shRNA, cells were treated with dox for 24 hrs prior to RNA extraction.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = RN2 cells derived from MLL-AF9/NrasG12D AML mouse model were cultured in RPMI with 10%FBS and P/S under 7.5% CO2. Bone marrow-derived myeloid progenitor cells were cultured in 10%FBS with 10 ng/ul SCF, 2 ng/ul IL-3, 2 ng/ul IL-6 and 50 uM beta-ME under 7.5% CO2. Human AML cell line was cultured in RPMI with 10%FBS and P/S under 7.5% CO2.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted using TRIzol following manufacture’s protocol. 2ug total RNA was used for constructing RNA-seq library
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were constructed using the Illumina TruSeq sample prep kit v2 following manufacture’s protocol. Briefly, RNA was polyA selected and enzymatically fragmented. cDNA was synthesized using Super Script II master mix, followed by end repair, A-tailing and PCR amplification.
!Sample_description = processed data file: BM_shREN vs RN2_shREN.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Single-end 50bp sequencing reads were mapped into mm9 genome using TopHat with default settings
!Sample_data_processing = Structural RNAs were masked
!Sample_data_processing = Differentially expressed genes were identified using Cuffdiff, normalized to total mapped reads
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm9/hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: txt files generated from Cuffdiff
